  "Elminster's Effulgent Spheres": s(6,"Evo",A,"Self","V, S, M","1 hour","Druid,Sorcerer,Wizard","Six spheres orbit you. When you take acid, cold, fire, lightning or thunder damage, you can use your reaction and a sphere to resist it until the start of your next turn. As a bonus action you can hurl a sphere at a target within 120 feet, a ranged spell attack for 3d6 damage of one of those types.",{material:"an opal worth at least 1,000 gp",source:"FRHoF"}),
  "Fizban's Platinum Shield": s(6,"Abj",B,"60 feet","V, S, M",CONC1M,"Sorcerer,Wizard","A creature you choose gains half cover, resistance to acid, cold, fire, lightning and poison damage, and evasion against Dexterity saves. As a bonus action you can move the field to another creature within 60 feet.",{material:"a platinum-plated dragon scale worth at least 500 gp",source:"FTD"}),
  "Gravity Fissure": s(6,"Evo",A,"Self (100-foot line)","V, S, M","Instantaneous","Dunamancy","Each creature in a 100-foot line makes a Constitution save, taking 8d8 force damage on a failure or half on a success. Creatures within 10 feet of the line also save or take 8d8 force damage and are pulled into it.",{material:"a fistful of iron filings",source:"EGW"}),
  // 7th level
  "Create Magen": s(7,"Tra","1 hour","Touch","V, S, M","Instantaneous","Wizard","Turn a stuffed, life-sized doll into a magen of your choice that obeys you without question. Your hit point maximum drops by the magen's challenge rating (at least 1), and only Wish restores it.",{material:"a vial of quicksilver worth 500 gp and a life-sized human doll, both consumed, and a crystal rod worth at least 1,500 gp",source:"IDRotF"}),
  "Draconic Transformation": s(7,"Tra",B,"Self","V, S, M",CONC1M,"Druid,Sorcerer,Wizard","You gain blindsight 30 feet and a flying speed of 60 feet. When you cast it, and as a bonus action on later turns, you can breathe a 60-foot cone: Dexterity save for 6d8 force damage, or half on a success.",{material:"a statuette of a dragon worth at least 500 gp",source:"FTD"}),
  "Simbul's Synostodweomer": s(7,"Tra",A,"Touch","V, S","1 hour","Sorcerer,Wizard","A creature you touch is filled with healing magic. Whenever it casts a spell with a spell slot, it can spend Hit Dice equal to the slot's level and regain the total rolled + your spellcasting modifier hit points.",{source:"FRHoF"}),
  "Tether Essence": s(7,"Nec",A,"60 feet","V, S, M",CONC1H,"Dunamancy","Two creatures make Constitution saves (with disadvantage within 30 feet of each other). If both fail, damage and healing to one also happen to the other, until one drops to 0 hit points.",{material:"a spool of platinum cord worth at least 250 gp, which the spell consumes",source:"EGW"}),
