  "Dark Star": s(8,"Evo",A,"150 feet","V, S, M",CONC1M,"Dunamancy","A sphere up to 40 feet in radius fills with magical darkness, silence and crushing gravity: difficult terrain where no verbal spells can be cast. A creature entering or starting its turn there makes a Constitution save, taking 8d10 force damage or half on a success, and is disintegrated at 0 hit points.",{material:"a shard of onyx and a drop of the caster's blood, both consumed",source:"EGW"}),
  "Holy Star of Mystra": s(8,"Evo",B,"Self","V, S",CONC1M,"Cleric,Wizard","A glowing mote hovers above you, and you have three-quarters cover. When you cast the spell, and as a bonus action on later turns, it fires a bolt at a creature within 120 feet, a ranged spell attack for 4d10 + your spellcasting modifier force or radiant damage. When you succeed on a save against a spell of 7th level or lower that targeted only you, you can use your reaction to turn it back on its caster.",{source:"FRHoF"}),
  "Reality Break": s(8,"Con",A,"60 feet","V, S, M",CONC1M,"Dunamancy","A creature makes a Wisdom save or can't take reactions, and at the start of each of its turns rolls a d10 for psychic damage and stunning, force damage, a painful teleport, or cold damage and blindness. It repeats the save at the end of each turn.",{material:"a crystal prism",source:"EGW"}),
  // 9th level
  "Ravenous Void": s(9,"Evo",A,"1,000 feet","V, S, M",CONC1M,"Dunamancy","A 20-foot-radius sphere of gravity makes everything within 100 feet difficult terrain and pulls creatures (Strength save) and loose objects toward its center. A creature in the sphere takes 5d10 force damage, is restrained, and is annihilated at 0 hit points.",{material:"a small nine-pointed star made of iron",source:"EGW"}),
  "Time Ravage": s(9,"Nec",A,"90 feet","V, S, M","Instantaneous","Dunamancy","A creature makes a Constitution save, taking 10d12 necrotic damage on a failure or half on a success. On a failure it also ages until it has 30 days to live, with disadvantage on attacks, checks and saves and half speed, curable only by Wish or a 9th-level Greater Restoration.",{material:"an hourglass of diamond dust worth at least 5,000 gp, which the spell consumes",source:"EGW"})
