  "Whirlwind": ["A whirlwind 10 feet in radius and 30 feet high spins up, and you can move it 30 feet with an action. A creature it touches makes a Dexterity save, taking 10d6 bludgeoning damage on a failure or half on a success. A Large or smaller creature that fails is also lifted and restrained."],
  "Heat Metal": ["A metal object glows red-hot. A creature touching it takes 2d8 fire damage, and you can use a bonus action on later turns to deal the damage again. A creature that keeps holding or wearing it has disadvantage on attacks and ability checks."],
