  "Slow": ["Up to six creatures in a 40-foot cube make a Wisdom save. One that fails moves at half speed, takes a -2 penalty to AC and Dexterity saves, can't take reactions and can use only an action or a bonus action on its turn.", "Up to six creatures in a 40-foot cube make a Wisdom save. One that fails moves at half speed, takes a -2 penalty to AC and Dexterity saves, can't take reactions and can use only an action or a bonus action on its turn. It repeats the save at the end of each of its turns."],
  "Vicious Mockery": ["The target makes a Wisdom save. On a failure it takes 1d4 psychic damage and has disadvantage on its next attack roll before the end of its next turn."],
